{
  "_file": "damned_waters/game/data/rooms/metro_centraal.json \u2014 RoomSpec for Metro 52 \u00b7 Centraal (the city, district 7: Centraal): line 52's platform deep under the station: an island between two tracks under a long concrete vault, white tiles on the walls. On one track the last train north stands with every door open, its lights on, humming; the other track is under black water, still rising. Its front wall is the street's shopfront (\"facade\": the street builds it); its door is the street's. Every business name is made up. Single source of truth for Blender (render) and the engine (collision, cameras, things).",
